<title>RUSSIA: Russian reserve assets fall in third quarter.</title>
<headline>Russian reserve assets fall in third quarter.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Russian Central Bank's reserve assets fell to $15.08 billion on October 1, 1996 from $15.88 billion on July 1, the Central Bank said in its latest bulletin.</p>
<p>It issued the following figures (million dollars):</p>
<p>				  Oct 1, 1996  Jul 1, 1996   Oct 1, 1995</p>
<p>    Reserve assets	     15,075	 15,877	  13,622</p>
